Devopsadmin Dashboard — Streamlit

A modern, professional control panel for operators.

Renders:
  - Sidebar:    system identity, live SMB service status, theme toggle
  - Header:     title + quick stats
  - Tabs:       Overview | Actions | Activity Log | Help
  - Confirm-before-execute dialogs
  - Live streaming output of long-running commands

Configuration is supplied via Ansible template variables:
